    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toad Tavern</strong> is a game where you play as a bartender in an illegal speakeasy amidst the 1920s prohibition era in <i>Amphibiopolis</i>. Under your boss and speakeasy owner, Don Pac, your drinks can make this speakeasy a major hop or a major flop.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/05ce12863f40c9ed94b7d0b73dd9fc28.avif?t=1742051525\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a series of simulation-style minigames to craft the perfect drink.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b9601553c16534b13b0b26239294b8b6.poster.avif?t=1742051525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b9601553c16534b13b0b26239294b8b6.webm?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b9601553c16534b13b0b26239294b8b6.mp4?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/c02c8553a77c670b4922a0797fe9c1a5.avif?t=1742051525\" data-has-big width=800 height=154 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes and drink variants as you master the art of bartending.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b153b0e204f3ff292ffdcc5e7a2aa576.poster.avif?t=1742051525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b153b0e204f3ff292ffdcc5e7a2aa576.webm?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b153b0e204f3ff292ffdcc5e7a2aa576.mp4?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/61bacc06067174b9ba5690335f555a78.avif?t=1742051525\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the right drinks and unlock hidden truths about the frogs that frequent the bar.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/2ffb1895feab7480bf50b70585b10673.poster.avif?t=1742051525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/2ffb1895feab7480bf50b70585b10673.webm?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/2ffb1895feab7480bf50b70585b10673.mp4?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toad Tavern</strong> is a game where you play as a bartender in an illegal speakeasy amidst the 1920s prohibition era in <i>Amphibiopolis</i>. Under your boss and speakeasy owner, Don Pac, your drinks can make this speakeasy a major hop or a major flop.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/05ce12863f40c9ed94b7d0b73dd9fc28.avif?t=1742051525\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a series of simulation-style minigames to craft the perfect drink.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b9601553c16534b13b0b26239294b8b6.poster.avif?t=1742051525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b9601553c16534b13b0b26239294b8b6.webm?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b9601553c16534b13b0b26239294b8b6.mp4?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/c02c8553a77c670b4922a0797fe9c1a5.avif?t=1742051525\" data-has-big width=800 height=154 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes and drink variants as you master the art of bartending.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b153b0e204f3ff292ffdcc5e7a2aa576.poster.avif?t=1742051525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b153b0e204f3ff292ffdcc5e7a2aa576.webm?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/b153b0e204f3ff292ffdcc5e7a2aa576.mp4?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/61bacc06067174b9ba5690335f555a78.avif?t=1742051525\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the right drinks and unlock hidden truths about the frogs that frequent the bar.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/2ffb1895feab7480bf50b70585b10673.poster.avif?t=1742051525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/2ffb1895feab7480bf50b70585b10673.webm?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/2ffb1895feab7480bf50b70585b10673.mp4?t=1742051525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
